@startuml
title Doctor project applications and institution-project full-edit workflow

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 1
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 90
hide footbox

actor "Authenticated active\ndoctor applicant" as Doctor
participant "Flutter\nprofessional client" as Flutter
participant "Management API\nproject requests" as API
database "Immutable request ledger\nproject request tables" as Ledger
actor "Target institution\nlegal representative" as LegalRep
actor "Platform\nadministrator" as Admin
database "Approved doctor-institution\nrelationship" as Relationship
database "Platform projects\nprojects" as Projects
database "Institution projects\ninstitution_projects" as InstitutionProjects
database "Applicant binding\ndoctor_projects" as DoctorProjects
database "Compatibility config\ndoctor_institution_project_configs" as Configs
collections "discover / home / projects\ncaches" as Caches
actor "Public client /\norder flow" as Public

legend left
  |= Contract |= Meaning |
  | payload v1 | JOIN / LEAVE and historical PROFILE_UPDATE; schedule is v1-only |
  | payload v2 | full EDIT snapshots; USD doctor price and server-derived travel fee |
  | null / blank / [] | normalize to null and inherit the platform-project field |
endlegend

group Project-creation applications (existing immutable workflow)
  Doctor -> Flutter: complete platform-project or institution-project form
  alt Platform project (exact 13 keys)
    Flutter -> API: POST /api/management/project-requests/platform
    API -> Ledger: INSERT PLATFORM immutable snapshot (PENDING, applicant doctor)
    Admin -> API: POST /api/admin/project-requests/{id}/review
    API -> Ledger: lock PENDING snapshot
    alt APPROVED
      API -> Projects: INSERT project
      API -> Ledger: CAS close APPROVED + resultingProjectId
    else REJECTED
      API -> Ledger: CAS close REJECTED + non-blank note
    end
  else Institution project (path institution + exact 18 keys)
    Flutter -> API: POST /api/management/project-requests/institutions/{institutionId}
    API -> API: require current APPROVED applicant relationship\nresolve inheritance; quote USD travel-ground fee
    API -> Ledger: INSERT INSTITUTION immutable snapshot (PENDING, applicant doctor)
    LegalRep -> API: POST /api/management/project-requests/{id}/review
    API -> API: re-check managedInstitutionIds in real time
    API -> Ledger: lock PENDING snapshot
    alt APPROVED in one transaction
      API -> Relationship: lock and re-check applicant relationship
      API -> InstitutionProjects: INSERT effective inherited content
      API -> DoctorProjects: INSERT applicant binding only
      API -> Configs: INSERT applicant compatibility config
      API -> Ledger: CAS close APPROVED + resultingInstitutionProjectId
    else REJECTED
      API -> Ledger: CAS close REJECTED + non-blank note
    end
  end
end

note over Flutter,Ledger
  v2 is the new collaboration root: /api/v2/admin/institution-project-requests.
  Its GET list is a payloadVersion 1|2 union. The v1 root remains for rolling
  compatibility; a v1 route asked to process a v2 row returns 426
  CLIENT_UPGRADE_REQUIRED. v2 JOIN/LEAVE retain their exact v1 writer shapes.
end note

group Full-edit target and submission (payload v2)
  Doctor -> Flutter: open an existing institution project
  Flutter -> API: GET /api/v2/admin/institution-project-requests/profile-update-targets
  API -> API: require authenticated doctor + active institution project\ncurrent APPROVED relationship
  API -> InstitutionProjects: read raw overrides, effective values, version
  API -> DoctorProjects: read applicant USD price, is_active, updated_at
  API -> Configs: read compatibility config revision (nullable)
  API --> Flutter: exact 15-key target\ncurrentProject + baseRevision + doctorActive\npolicy revision + server-derived travel fee

  note over API,Configs
    baseRevision is a canonical SHA-256 over association, institution-project
    version, platform inheritance hash, applicant doctor-project revision,
    nullable config id/revision, and pricing-policy revision.
  end note

  Flutter -> API: POST /api/v2/admin/institution-project-requests\nexact 15 keys; requestType=PROFILE_UPDATE
  API -> Relationship: require current APPROVED applicant relationship
  API -> InstitutionProjects: lock target and platform association
  API -> Projects: lock inheritance source
  API -> DoctorProjects: lock applicant binding
  API -> Configs: lock applicant config revision (nullable)
  API -> API: normalize null/blank/[] inheritance\nrecompute baseRevision and USD travel fee
  alt edit baseline changed
    API --> Flutter: HTTP 409 EDIT_BASE_STALE
  else valid current baseline
    API -> API: build currentProject + proposedProject snapshots\nsharedChanged = shared overrides or salesCount changed
    API -> Ledger: INSERT immutable snapshots, baselines, policy,\ncurrent/proposed applicant price + is_active (PENDING)
    API --> Flutter: payloadVersion=2, requestType=EDIT
  end
end

group Review list, ordinary decision, and admin force
  LegalRep -> API: GET /api/v2/admin/institution-project-requests
  API -> Ledger: read immutable current/proposed snapshots
  API -> InstitutionProjects: read latest effective project
  API -> DoctorProjects: read latest applicant price + is_active
  API -> Configs: read latest compatibility config
  API --> LegalRep: latestProject/latestDoctor* + latestRevision\nsharedChanged, snapshotState, reviewable

  alt Target institution legal representative
    LegalRep -> API: POST /{id}/review\n{decision, reviewNote, force:false, forceBaseRevision:null}
  else Platform administrator
    Admin -> API: POST /{id}/review\nordinary body or explicit force body
  end
  API -> Ledger: read identity, then lock PENDING request
  API -> API: re-check admin or current managedInstitutionIds authority
  alt REJECTED or CHANGES_REQUESTED
    API -> Ledger: CAS close only; non-blank reviewNote
  else APPROVED
    note over API,Configs
      Fixed approval lock order after the request row:
      active relationship -> institution project -> platform project ->
      applicant doctor project -> applicant config (including deleted row).
    end note
    API -> Relationship: lock current APPROVED relationship
    API -> InstitutionProjects: lock target
    API -> Projects: lock platform inheritance source
    API -> DoctorProjects: lock applicant binding
    API -> Configs: lock applicant compatibility config
    API -> API: validate association, immutable snapshots, normalization,\ninherited source, policy/rederived fee, and drift

    alt ordinary approval and any baseline drift
      API --> LegalRep: HTTP 409 APPROVAL_BASE_STALE
    else force=true
      API -> API: require ADMIN + APPROVED + non-blank note\nforceBaseRevision == freshly read latestRevision\nat least one allowed baseline drift
      note right of API
        Force may accept institution-project version, applicant price/active/
        revision, or compatibility-config revision drift only. It never bypasses
        authority, active relationship, target association/existence, snapshot
        validity/normalization, inheritance-source or pricing-policy checks,
        request CAS, and it is not available for payload v1.
      end note
      alt latest confirmation changed / no applicable drift
        API --> Admin: 409 FORCE_BASE_STALE or 422 FORCE_NOT_APPLICABLE
      end
    end

    alt sharedChanged = true
      API -> InstitutionProjects: version CAS; update shared fields; version + 1
    else sharedChanged = false
      API -> InstitutionProjects: no shared write; version unchanged
    end
    API -> DoctorProjects: update applicant only: price + is_active
    API -> Configs: sync applicant-only compatibility medical_list_price
    API -> Ledger: status=PENDING CAS close + audit snapshot
    API -> Caches: afterCommit clear discover, home, projects
  end
end

note over API,Ledger
  Stable contract errors use {code, message, errorCode, data:null}.
  409: EDIT_BASE_STALE, APPROVAL_BASE_STALE, INHERITANCE_SOURCE_STALE,
  PRICING_POLICY_STALE, FORCE_BASE_STALE, REQUEST_ALREADY_PENDING,
  REQUEST_ALREADY_HANDLED, INSTITUTION_PROJECT_VERSION_STALE.
  422: PROJECT_PAYLOAD_INVALID, REQUEST_SNAPSHOT_INVALID, FORCE_NOT_APPLICABLE.
  426: CLIENT_UPGRADE_REQUIRED. Clients branch on errorCode, never message.
end note

group Platform-admin direct edit (separate CAS path)
  Admin -> API: PUT /api/admin/institution-projects/{id}\nexact 17 keys including baseVersion + doctorBindings
  API -> API: require platform ADMIN
  note over API,Configs
    Global lock order: sorted pending doctor-change requests -> sorted pending
    split proposals -> sorted active relationships (NOWAIT) -> institution project
    -> revalidate pending sets (NOWAIT) -> platform project -> all doctor projects
    -> config participants -> doctor configs.
  end note
  alt baseVersion/participants/locks changed
    API --> Admin: HTTP 409 INSTITUTION_PROJECT_VERSION_STALE
  else current CAS baseline
    API -> InstitutionProjects: update direct-admin fields
    API -> DoctorProjects: synchronize doctor bindings and USD prices
    API -> Configs: synchronize applicant compatibility prices
    API -> Caches: afterCommit clear discover, home, projects
  end
end

group Public visibility and bookability
  Public -> API: list/search/filter, doctor or institution details,\ndoctor candidates, quote, or create order
  API -> Relationship: require effective APPROVED relationship
  API -> InstitutionProjects: require is_active=true
  API -> DoctorProjects: require is_active=true for every public/bookable binding
  alt quote or order
    API -> Relationship: lock and re-check relationship
    API -> InstitutionProjects: lock and re-check active target
    API -> DoctorProjects: lock and re-check active doctor binding
    API --> Public: server-derived USD quote / order result
  else direct institution-project detail only
    Public -> API: GET /api/discover/institutions/{institutionId}/projects/{projectId}
    alt active institution project but no bookable doctor
      API --> Public: 200 detail; hasAvailableDoctors=false; doctors=[]\nprice falls back to institution-project price; ordering remains forbidden
    else bookable doctors exist
      API --> Public: 200 detail with active doctors and minimum doctor price
    end
  else public collection has no bookable doctor
    API --> Public: omit the institution project from collection results
  end
end

@enduml
